<title>USA: Excel in India licensing pact.</title>
<headline>Excel in India licensing pact.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Industries Inc said Tuesday said it has licensed seat manufacturing technology to IFB Industries Ltd of Bangalore, India.</p>
<p>The agreement covers seating technology for the local automotive markets in the Middle East and Far East, said Excel, an automotive equipment supplier.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The partnership with IFB is the first in India for Excel.</p>
<p>Excel shares were up 1/8, at 15-1/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
